> Conclusion

The report keeps every fitted operation,original channel and source class visible. Genuine signal plots and complete held-out diagnostics constrain conclusions beyond fitting-loss reduction or numerical sensitivity. Paired saved normalization makes raw-signal-only inference reproducible.

> References

- [Official ECG200 source](https://www.timeseriesclassification.com/description.php?Dataset=ECG200).
- [Official BasicMotions source and channel order](https://www.timeseriesclassification.com/description.php?Dataset=BasicMotions).
- [He et al.(2016),Deep Residual Learning for Image Recognition](https://arxiv.org/abs/1512.03385);the source teaching temporal architecture is an explicit variant,not the paper model.
